    "chunk_text": "swa be DE IANVARIO. Se forma d\u00e6g, & eall se mon\u00f0, ys gehalgod mid Cristes gebyrdtide. & he h\u00e6f\u00f0 an & \u00ferittig daga \u00e6fter sunnan ryne, & \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6s monan ryne \u00ferittig, & seo niht by\u00f0 Ealra tida \u00fees mon\u00f0 h\u00e6f\u00f0 seofon hund tida & feower & feowertig; & on \u00feissum mon\u00f0e g\u00e6\u00f0 seo DE FEBRVARIO. Se o\u00f0er mon\u00f0 hatte Februarius. He h\u00e6f\u00f0 eahta & twentig daga \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re sunnan ryne \u00fereo ger; on \u00feam feor\u00f0an geare, he h\u00e6f\u00f0 Ac \u00e6rest ys to witanne \u00fe\u00e6t se mona sceal habban his bissextum, \u00fe\u00e6t ys \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00fey geare anum Februarius h\u00e6f\u00f0 lunam uigessimam (641) nonam \u00fereo gear, & \u00feonne he sceal habban \u00ferittig nihta Nu we ealles spr\u00e6ce habba\u00f0 ymbe \u00feone wundorlican bissextum, hyt by\u00f0 geradlic \u00fe\u00e6t we ascrutnion DE BISSEXTO. On \u00feam geare \u00fee man h\u00e6t solarem on Lyden beo\u00f0 \u00fereo hund daga & fif & syxtig daga, & syx tida. \u00dea synd on Lyden quadrantes genemned. Of \u00feissum syx tidum aspring\u00f0 up bissextus. Feower si\u00f0on syx beo\u00f0 feower & twentig: swa fela tida beo\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6nne on \u00feam d\u00e6ge & on \u00fe\u00e6re nihte. DE BISSEXTO. Gyt we eow cy\u00f0a\u00f0 ymbe \u00feone arwyr\u00f0an bissextum. For\u00feon Romani hine gelogodon on \u00feissum mon\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t ys on Februario, for\u00feam he ys scyrtest",
